[CENTER][B][SIZE=6]WorldGuard ExtraFlags Plus (WGEFP)[/SIZE][/B][/CENTER]

[B]Release 4.4.6[/B]

An advanced WorldGuard extension that adds [B]45+ extra region flags[/B] for full control of player behavior, teleportation, and region rules — featuring Folia support, item blocking (Mace, Firework, Wind Charge, Totem, Goat Horn, Spears), throwable-only blocking ([I]disable-throw[/I] for egg, snowball, pearl, XP bottle), optional PacketEvents/ProtocolLib packet hooks for full [I]disable-completely[/I] coverage, and fully customizable messages.

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#E9d502][B]⚠️ WARNING DO NOT USE BOTH PLUGINS TOGETHER![/B][/COLOR][/SIZE]

If you're upgrading from [I]WorldGuardExtraFlags[/I] to [I]WorldGuardExtraFlagsPlus[/I], make sure to:
[LIST]
[*][B]Remove[/B] the old [I]WorldGuardExtraFlags.jar[/I] plugin file
[*][B]Only keep[/B] [I]WorldGuardExtraFlagsPlus.jar[/I] on your server
[*]Both plugins cannot coexist - they will conflict with each other
[/LIST]

[B][SIZE=5]📖 Full Flag Usage Guide[/SIZE][/B]
For comprehensive usage examples and detailed flag documentation, see the [B][URL=https://tinsware.github.io/wiki/docs/games/minecraft/plugins/worldguard-extraflags-plus/flag-usage]Complete Flag Usage Guide[/URL][/B] on the tinsware Wiki.

[B][SIZE=5]Why WorldGuard Extra Flags Plus?[/SIZE][/B]
[LIST]
[*]🪓 [B]Item & Throwable Control[/B] — [I]disable-completely[/I] (Mace, Firework, Wind Charge, Totem, Trident, Goat Horn, Spears), [I]disable-throw[/I] (egg / snowball / pearl / XP bottle), [I]deny-item-drops[/I] / [I]deny-item-pickup[/I]
[*]🚪 [B]Entry Control[/B] — XP or PlaceholderAPI level gates ([I]entry-min-level[/I] / [I]entry-max-level[/I]), permission gates ([I]entry-permission[/I] / [I]entry-deny-permission[/I]), [I]player-count-limit[/I]
[*]⚙️ [B]Region Automation[/B] — [I]command-on-entry[/I] / [I]command-on-exit[/I], [I]console-command-on-entry[/I] / [I]console-command-on-exit[/I], repeating console commands ([I]console-command-repeat[/I], [I]console-command-timer[/I]), chat prefix / suffix with PlaceholderAPI; command flags support [I]%uuid%[/I]
[*]🧱 [B]Block & World Interaction[/B] — block place/break control (incl. buckets & waterlogged blocks), [I]enderchest-access[/I], [I]permit-workbenches[/I], [I]inventory-craft[/I], [I]villager-trade[/I], [I]disable-collision[/I], [I]chunk-unload[/I], [I]nether-portals[/I], [I]worldedit[/I], [I]lightning-damage[/I], [I]frostwalker[/I], [I]play-sounds[/I]
[*]🧟 [B]Mob & Spawn Control[/B] — [I]deny-mobspawn[/I] by category or entity type
[*]🛡️ [B]Player Protection & Effects[/B] — [I]godmode[/I], [I]keep-inventory[/I] (incl. DeluxeCombat), [I]keep-exp[/I], [I]item-durability[/I], [I]fly[/I] / [I]glide[/I] / speed flags, [I]blocked-effects[/I] / [I]give-effects[/I]
[*]✨ [B]Extras[/B] — Folia support, Paper 1.21 – 26.2+, customizable messages + cooldown, update checker, [I]hide-players[/I] & [I]chambered-enderpearl[/I] (experimental)
[/LIST]

[B][SIZE=5]Flag List (45+)[/SIZE][/B]
All managed with standard WorldGuard flag commands.

[CODE]
[teleport-on-entry / teleport-on-exit]  [command-on-entry / command-on-exit]
[console-command-on-entry / console-command-on-exit]  [console-command-repeat / console-command-timer]
[walk-speed / fly-speed]  [fly]  [glide](elytra-blocker)  [frostwalker]
[keep-inventory / keep-exp]  [godmode]  [item-durability]
[chat-prefix / chat-suffix]  [blocked-effects]  [give-effects]  [play-sounds]
[respawn-location]  [join-location](not-on-folia)  [worldedit]
[nether-portals]  [chunk-unload]  [villager-trade]  [inventory-craft]
[allow-block-place / deny-block-place]  [allow-block-break / deny-block-break]
[deny-item-drops / deny-item-pickup]  [permit-workbenches]  [enderchest-access]
[disable-completely]  [disable-throw]  [lightning-damage]  [disable-collision]
[entry-min-level / entry-max-level]  [entry-permission / entry-deny-permission]
[deny-mobspawn]  [player-count-limit]  [hide-players](experimental)  [chambered-enderpearl](experimental)
[/CODE]

[B][SIZE=5]Version Compatibility[/SIZE][/B]
[TABLE]
[TR][TH]Minecraft[/TH][TH]WorldGuard[/TH][TH]ExtraFlagsPlus[/TH][TH]Support[/TH][/TR]
[TR][TD]1.21 – 26.2+[/TD][TD]7.0.15+[/TD][TD]4.4.6+[/TD][TD][COLOR=#00FF00]✅ Active[/COLOR][/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD]1.7 – 1.19[/TD][TD]Older[/TD][TD]-[/TD][TD][COLOR=#FF0000]❌ No support[/COLOR][/TD][/TR]
[/TABLE]

The jar declares [I]api-version: 1.21[/I] in [I]plugin.yml[/I] so Paper [B]1.21.x[/B] servers (and forks such as Canvas) load it.

[B][SIZE=5]Message Customization[/SIZE][/B]
All plugin messages live in [I]plugins/WorldGuard/messages-wgefp.yml[/I].

[LIST]
[*]Edit freely to match your style; color codes supported ([I]&c[/I], [I]&7[/I], etc.); disable messages with [I]""[/I]
[*]Placeholders: [I]{permission}[/I], [I]{required}[/I], [I]{current}[/I], [I]{item}[/I], [I]{workbench}[/I] (e.g. [I]disable-throw-blocked[/I] uses [I]{item}[/I])
[*]Message cooldown (default 2 seconds) prevents spam; reload instantly with [I]/wgefp reload[/I] or [I]/wg reload[/I]
[/LIST]

